### Property CRUD — Homebase API
### Base URL: http://localhost:3000
### Owner ID must reference an existing UserProfile.id (valid UUID)

### Create a Property
POST http://localhost:3000/properties
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sunset Apartments",
  "address": "123 Sunset Blvd, Nairobi",
  "ownerId": "01a090b1-6dbf-7658-8b71-478965dbbc11",
  "caretakerId": "01a090b1-6e8f-70cd-b0c1-035fef6ddc0d"
}

### Get All Properties (with optional pagination)
GET http://localhost:3000/properties
### Or with pagination:
# GET http://localhost:3000/properties?page=1&limit=10

### Get a Single Property by ID
GET http://localhost:3000/properties/01a08fb7-a7dc-7491-87f7-10b7ce672974

### Update a Property
PATCH http://localhost:3000/properties/01a08fb7-a7dc-7491-87f7-10b7ce672974
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sunset Gardens",
  "address": "456 Sunset Blvd, Nairobi"
}

### Delete a Property
DELETE http://localhost:3000/properties/01a08fb7-a7dc-7491-87f7-10b7ce672974
